I've run it in MiNT, but not via MGR.  You don't need the MiNT-aware
version (and 3.0f is probably rife with bugs anyway); I use 3.0j as
compiled for TOS.  You might try running it under the vt52 emulator;
make sure your termcap has an entry for it first, of course.  Especially
check that the `cm' attribute looks like `:cm=\EY%+ %+ :'

The reason that I'm posting instead of e-mailing is that I have an
additional question:  does anyone know now to run in color under MiNT?
I know the right escape sequences, but termcap doesn't seem to have a
"set character color" attribute to put them in.  Ideas?

